# Computer Systems and Library Systems.

**Authors:** Purcell, Royal

## Abstract
Describes the components of computer systems and library systems, and discusses several topics related to computer systems in the library environment: the systems approach and libraries; systems engineering and systems environment; natural and artificial systems; the importance of the systems approach; and the understanding of computer systems and the concepts of dynamics and statics. (MES)

